#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Review security status, active headers, hardening features, and Content "
"Security Policy."
msgstr ""
"Consultez l’état de sécurité, les en-têtes actifs, les fonctions de "
"durcissement et la Content Security Policy."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-dashboard-widget.php
msgid "Security overview"
msgstr "Aperçu de la sécurité"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-dashboard-widget.php
msgid "Security status"
msgstr "État de la sécurité"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-dashboard-widget.php
msgid "Active headers"
msgstr "En-têtes actifs"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
msgid "%1$d of %2$d security headers are enabled"
msgstr "%1$d en-tête(s) de sécurité sur %2$d sont activés"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Additional features"
msgstr "Fonctions supplémentaires"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
msgid "%1$d of %2$d additional features are enabled"
msgstr "%1$d fonction(s) supplémentaire(s) sur %2$d sont activées"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-dashboard-widget.php
msgid "CSP status"
msgstr "État CSP"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
#: includes/class-ash-dashboard-widget.php
msgctxt "CSP status"
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Activée"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
#: includes/class-ash-dashboard-widget.php
msgctxt "CSP status"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Désactivée"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
msgid "Content Security Policy is being sent with responses."
msgstr "La Content Security Policy est envoyée avec les réponses."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
msgid "Content Security Policy is currently turned off."
msgstr "La Content Security Policy est actuellement désactivée."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Configure each HTTP security header and the values sent with responses."
msgstr ""
"Configurez chaque en-tête de sécurité HTTP et les valeurs envoyées avec les "
"réponses."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Deprecated / Legacy"
msgstr "Obsolète / héritage"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Legacy browser XSS filter. Modern browsers ignore this header; prefer "
"Content-Security-Policy."
msgstr ""
"Filtre XSS des anciens navigateurs. Les navigateurs modernes ignorent cet "
"en-tête ; préférez Content-Security-Policy."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable X-XSS-Protection"
msgstr "Activer X-XSS-Protection"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Send the X-XSS-Protection header with the selected policy."
msgstr "Envoie l’en-tête X-XSS-Protection avec la politique sélectionnée."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Politique"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose the legacy XSS filter policy sent to older browsers."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez la politique du filtre XSS héritée envoyée aux anciens "
"navigateurs."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Reporting URL"
msgstr "URL de rapport"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Endpoint that receives XSS filter reports when the report policy is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Point de terminaison qui reçoit les rapports du filtre XSS lorsque la "
"politique report est choisie."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"The default policy is 0, which turns the legacy filter off when the header "
"is sent."
msgstr ""
"La politique par défaut est 0 et désactive le filtre hérité lorsque l’en-"
"tête est envoyé."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Prevents browsers from MIME-sniffing a response away from the declared "
"content type."
msgstr ""
"Empêche le navigateur d’inférer un type MIME différent de celui déclaré."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable X-Content-Type-Options"
msgstr "Activer X-Content-Type-Options"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"When enabled, the plugin always sends nosniff. There are no additional "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Une fois activé, le plugin envoie toujours nosniff. Il n’y a pas d’autres "
"options."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "When enabled, always send X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff."
msgstr "Une fois activé, X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff est toujours envoyé."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 jour"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "1 Week"
msgstr "1 semaine"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "1 Month"
msgstr "1 mois"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "6 Months"
msgstr "6 mois"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "1 Year"
msgstr "1 an"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "2 Years"
msgstr "2 ans"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom value"
msgstr "Valeur personnalisée"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Forces browsers to use HTTPS for future requests to this host."
msgstr ""
"Force les navigateurs à utiliser HTTPS pour les futures requêtes vers cet "
"hôte."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Strict-Transport-Security"
msgstr "Activer Strict-Transport-Security"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Instruct browsers to use HTTPS for this host for the configured lifetime."
msgstr ""
"Indique aux navigateurs d’utiliser HTTPS pour cet hôte pendant la durée "
"configurée."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "How long browsers should remember to use HTTPS only."
msgstr "Durée pendant laquelle les navigateurs doivent n’utiliser que HTTPS."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom max-age (seconds)"
msgstr "max-age personnalisé (secondes)"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enter max-age in seconds."
msgstr "Saisissez max-age en secondes."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Include Subdomains"
msgstr "Inclure les sous-domaines"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Adds includeSubDomains so the policy also applies to subdomains."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute includeSubDomains pour appliquer aussi la politique aux sous-"
"domaines."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Preload"
msgstr "Preload"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Adds preload. Requires includeSubDomains and a max-age of at least one year."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute preload. Nécessite includeSubDomains et un max-age d’au moins un an."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"This header is sent only over HTTPS. Preload requires includeSubDomains and "
"max-age of at least 31536000."
msgstr ""
"Cet en-tête n’est envoyé qu’en HTTPS. Preload exige includeSubDomains et un "
"max-age d’au moins 31536000."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Restricts access to powerful browser features such as camera and "
"geolocation."
msgstr ""
"Restreint l’accès aux fonctions sensibles du navigateur, comme la caméra et "
"la géolocalisation."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Permissions-Policy"
msgstr "Activer Permissions-Policy"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Control which origins may use powerful browser features."
msgstr ""
"Contrôle les origines autorisées à utiliser des fonctions sensibles du "
"navigateur."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Directives"
msgstr "Directives"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom Directives"
msgstr "Directives personnalisées"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Add feature names that are not listed above. Directives set to Not Set are "
"omitted from the header."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez des noms de fonctions absents ci-dessus. Les directives « Non "
"défini » sont omises de l’en-tête."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Directive name"
msgstr "Nom de la directive"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Add directive"
msgstr "Ajouter une directive"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Directives configured as Not Set, or with Enable Directive turned off, are "
"not included in the generated header."
msgstr ""
"Les directives « Non défini » ou dont l’activation est désactivée ne "
"figurent pas dans l’en-tête généré."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Controls whether the site can be embedded in frames to reduce clickjacking "
"risk."
msgstr ""
"Contrôle l’intégration du site dans des frames afin de réduire le "
"clickjacking."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable X-Frame-Options"
msgstr "Activer X-Frame-Options"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Control whether the site may be embedded in frames."
msgstr "Contrôle si le site peut être intégré dans des frames."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"DENY blocks all framing. SAMEORIGIN allows framing by this origin only. "
"ALLOW-FROM is obsolete and is not offered."
msgstr ""
"DENY bloque tout framing. SAMEORIGIN n’autorise que cette origine. ALLOW-"
"FROM est obsolète et n’est pas proposé."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "The default policy is SAMEORIGIN."
msgstr "La politique par défaut est SAMEORIGIN."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "privacy/security sensitive"
msgstr "sensible pour la confidentialité/sécurité"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Limits referrer information sent with navigations and resource requests."
msgstr ""
"Limite les informations de referrer envoyées lors des navigations et des "
"requêtes de ressources."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Referrer-Policy"
msgstr "Activer Referrer-Policy"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Control how much referrer information is sent with requests."
msgstr ""
"Contrôle la quantité d’informations de referrer envoyée avec les requêtes."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose the Referrer-Policy value sent with responses."
msgstr "Choisissez la valeur Referrer-Policy envoyée avec les réponses."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "unsafe-url sends the full URL across origins and is privacy-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"unsafe-url envoie l’URL complète entre origines et est sensible pour la "
"confidentialité."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "The default policy is strict-origin-when-cross-origin."
msgstr "La politique par défaut est strict-origin-when-cross-origin."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Directive"
msgstr "Activer la directive"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Include this directive in the generated Permissions-Policy header."
msgstr "Inclure cette directive dans l’en-tête Permissions-Policy généré."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Supprimer"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose how this feature may be used."
msgstr "Choisissez comment cette fonction peut être utilisée."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom Origins"
msgstr "Origines personnalisées"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"One origin per line. Use self or full origins such as https://example.com."
msgstr ""
"Une origine par ligne. Utilisez self ou des origines complètes comme "
"https://example.com."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Not Set"
msgstr "Non défini"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Deny All"
msgstr "Tout refuser"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Self"
msgstr "Self"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Allow All"
msgstr "Tout autoriser"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php includes/class-ash-admin.php
msgid "Security Features"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités de sécurité"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Configure WordPress hardening without turning off legitimate site features "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Configurez le durcissement WordPress sans désactivér par défaut des "
"fonctionnalites legitimes du site."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Hides server technology details exposed by the X-Powered-By header."
msgstr "Masque les détails techniques du serveur exposés par X-Powered-By."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Remove X-Powered-By Header"
msgstr "Activer la suppression de l'en-tete X-Powered-By"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"When enabled, the plugin removes the X-Powered-By response header. There are"
" no additional options."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'il est active, le plugin supprime l'en-tete de reponse X-Powered-By. "
"Il n'y a pas d'options supplémentaires."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"WordPress exposes generator information in HTML, RSS, Atom, and RDF output."
msgstr ""
"WordPress expose des informations generator dans les sorties HTML, RSS, Atom"
" et RDF."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Hide WordPress Version"
msgstr "Activer le masquage de la version WordPress"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Turn on WordPress version hiding, then choose which generator outputs to "
"remove."
msgstr ""
"Activez le masquage de la version WordPress, puis choisissez quelles sorties"
" generator supprimer."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Hide Generator Meta Version"
msgstr "Masquer la version meta generator"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Removes the generator meta tag from HTML output."
msgstr "Supprime la balise meta generator de la sortie HTML."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Hide Version from RSS / Atom / RDF Feeds"
msgstr "Masquer la version des flux RSS / Atom / RDF"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Removes generator version strings from RSS, Atom, and RDF feeds."
msgstr "Supprime les chaînes de version generator des flux RSS, Atom et RDF."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Version query parameters are not removed from CSS or JavaScript assets, so "
"cache busting keeps working."
msgstr ""
"Les parametres de version ne sont pas retires des fichiers CSS ou "
"JavaScript, afin que l'invalidation du cache continue de fonctionner."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Generic Error"
msgstr "Erreur générique"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Hide Error Completely"
msgstr "Masquer complètement l'erreur"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom Error Message"
msgstr "Message d'erreur personnalisé"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Stop login failure responses from revealing whether a username or email "
"address exists."
msgstr ""
"Empechez les reponses d'échec de connexion de reveler si un identifiant ou "
"une adresse e-mail existe."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Login Error Protection"
msgstr "Activer la protection des erreurs de connexion"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Only authentication failure messages are changed. Informational and "
"successful login messages are left alone."
msgstr ""
"Seuls les messages d'échec d'authentification sont modifies. Les messages "
"d'information et de connexion réussie restent inchanges."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Error Mode"
msgstr "Mode d'erreur"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose how authentication failure messages are shown."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez comment les messages d'échec d'authentification sont affiches."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "This plain-text message replaces authentication failure errors."
msgstr ""
"Ce message en texte brut remplace les erreurs d'échec d'authentification."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Recommended mode is Generic Error. The default message is Invalid username "
"or password."
msgstr ""
"Le mode recommande est Erreur generique. Le message par défaut est : Nom "
"d'utilisateur ou mot de passe non valide."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Disable Authenticated XML-RPC Methods"
msgstr "Désactiver les méthodes XML-RPC authentifiees"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Disable Pingback Methods Only"
msgstr "Désactiver uniquement les méthodes Pingback"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Disable All XML-RPC Methods"
msgstr "Désactiver toutes les méthodes XML-RPC"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Custom Method Policy"
msgstr "Politique de méthodes personnalisée"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "High impact"
msgstr "Impact élevé"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"The WordPress xmlrpc_enabled filter only disables methods that require "
"authentication. Pingbacks and some other methods can remain available."
msgstr ""
"Le filtre WordPress xmlrpc_enabled ne désactivé que les méthodes qui exigent"
" une authentification. Les pingbacks et d'autres méthodes peuvent rester "
"disponibles."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable XML-RPC Protection"
msgstr "Activer la protection XML-RPC"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Apply a selected XML-RPC policy instead of a single on/off switch."
msgstr ""
"Appliquez une politique XML-RPC sélectionnée au lieu d'un simple "
"interrupteur."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Protection Mode"
msgstr "Mode de protection"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose which XML-RPC methods remain available."
msgstr "Choisissez quelles méthodes XML-RPC restent disponibles."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Disable All XML-RPC Methods is the strongest restriction. Some applications "
"and integrations depend on XML-RPC."
msgstr ""
"Désactiver toutes les méthodes XML-RPC est la restriction la plus forte. "
"Certaines applications et integrations dependent de XML-RPC."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Allowed XML-RPC Methods"
msgstr "Méthodes XML-RPC autorisées"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"One method name per line. If this list is not empty, only these methods "
"remain."
msgstr ""
"Un nom de méthode par ligne. Si cette liste n'est pas vide, seules ces "
"méthodes restent."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Blocked XML-RPC Methods"
msgstr "Méthodes XML-RPC bloquées"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"One method name per line. These methods are removed even if they appear in "
"the allow list."
msgstr ""
"Un nom de méthode par ligne. Ces méthodes sont retirees meme si elles "
"figurent dans la liste autorisée."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Pingback mode blocks pingback.ping and pingback.extensions.getPingbacks. "
"Removing the X-Pingback header is recommended when pingbacks or all XML-RPC "
"methods are blocked."
msgstr ""
"Le mode Pingback bloque pingback.ping et pingback.extensions.getPingbacks. "
"La suppression de l'en-tete X-Pingback est recommandee lorsque les pingbacks"
" ou toutes les méthodes XML-RPC sont bloques."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Removes the X-Pingback response header from WordPress output."
msgstr "Retire l’en-tête de réponse X-Pingback de la sortie WordPress."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable Remove X-Pingback Header"
msgstr "Activer la suppression de l'en-tete X-Pingback"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"When enabled, the plugin removes the X-Pingback header. There are no "
"additional options."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'il est active, le plugin supprime l'en-tete X-Pingback. Il n'y a pas "
"d'options supplémentaires."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"XML-RPC pingback protection or complete XML-RPC blocking is enabled. "
"Removing the X-Pingback header is recommended."
msgstr ""
"La protection Pingback XML-RPC ou le blocage complet de XML-RPC est active. "
"La suppression de l'en-tete X-Pingback est recommandee."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "WordPress Default"
msgstr "Valeur par défaut de WordPress"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Authenticated Users Only"
msgstr "Utilisateurs authentifiés uniquement"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Selected Roles"
msgstr "Rôles sélectionnés"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Required Capability"
msgstr "Capacité requise"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Administrators Only"
msgstr "Administrateurs uniquement"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Block All REST Access"
msgstr "Bloquer tout accès REST"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Apply a REST access policy. Gutenberg and other dashboard tools need REST "
"access for authenticated users."
msgstr ""
"Appliquez une politique d'accès REST. Gutenberg et d'autres outils du "
"tableau de bord ont besoin de REST pour les utilisateurs authentifies."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Enable REST API Access Control"
msgstr "Activer le contrôle d'accès REST API"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"When this is off, WordPress REST behavior is unchanged except for optional "
"user-endpoint protection below."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque c'est désactivé, le comportement REST de WordPress reste inchange, "
"sauf la protection facultative des points de terminaison utilisateur ci-"
"dessous."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Access Policy"
msgstr "Politique d'accès"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"WordPress Default applies no extra restriction. Administrators Only uses the"
" manage_options capability."
msgstr ""
"Valeur par défaut de WordPress n'applique aucune restriction supplémentaire."
" Administrateurs uniquement utilise la capacite manage_options."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Block All REST Access is not recommended as a default. Gutenberg, Site "
"Health, plugins, themes, and integrations may stop working."
msgstr ""
"Bloquer tout accès REST n'est pas recommande par défaut. Gutenberg, Sante du"
" site, extensions, themes et integrations peuvent cesser de fonctionner."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Roles are loaded from WordPress, including custom roles. Super Admins on "
"Multisite are allowed."
msgstr ""
"Les rôles sont charges depuis WordPress, y compris les rôles personnalisés. "
"Les Super Admins en multisite sont autorisés."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Access is allowed when the current user has this WordPress capability. "
"Examples: read, edit_posts, edit_pages, manage_options."
msgstr ""
"L'accès est autorisé lorsque l'utilisateur actuel possede cette capacite "
"WordPress. Exemples : read, edit_posts, edit_pages, manage_options."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "REST API Exceptions"
msgstr "Exceptions REST API"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Allow lists bypass the access policy. Restricted lists always block matching"
" namespaces or routes."
msgstr ""
"Les listes autorisées contournent la politique d'accès. Les listes "
"restreintes bloquent toujours les espaces de noms ou les routes "
"correspondants."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Allowed Namespaces"
msgstr "Espaces de noms autorisés"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"One namespace per line, such as wp/v2 or wc/v3. Custom plugin namespaces are"
" allowed."
msgstr ""
"Un espace de noms par ligne, par exemple wp/v2 ou wc/v3. Les espaces de noms"
" d'extensions personnalisés sont autorisés."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Allowed Routes"
msgstr "Routes autorisées"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"One route per line, such as /wp/v2/posts. Matching prefixes are included."
msgstr ""
"Une route par ligne, par exemple /wp/v2/posts. Les prefixes correspondants "
"sont inclus."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Restricted Namespaces"
msgstr "Espaces de noms restreints"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"These namespaces are blocked even if the access policy would allow them."
msgstr ""
"Ces espaces de noms sont bloques meme si la politique d'accès les "
"autorisait."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Restricted Routes"
msgstr "Routes restreintes"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "These routes are blocked even if the access policy would allow them."
msgstr "Ces routes sont bloquees meme si la politique d'accès les autorisait."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "REST User Endpoint Protection"
msgstr "Protection des points de terminaison REST utilisateur"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Protect /wp/v2/users without disabling the rest of the REST API. This option"
" can run even when Access Control is off."
msgstr ""
"Protegez /wp/v2/users sans désactivér le reste de la REST API. Cette option "
"peut fonctionner meme si le contrôle d'accès est désactivé."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Restrict REST User Endpoints"
msgstr "Restreindre les points de terminaison REST utilisateur"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"Applies an extra policy to user-related REST routes such as /wp/v2/users."
msgstr ""
"Applique une politique supplémentaire aux routes REST utilisateur telles que"
" /wp/v2/users."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "Choose who may access WordPress user REST endpoints."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez qui peut acceder aux points de terminaison REST des utilisateurs "
"WordPress."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid "User endpoints are allowed when the current user has this capability."
msgstr ""
"Les points de terminaison utilisateur sont autorisés lorsque l'utilisateur "
"actuel possede cette capacite."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php
msgid ""
"REST API Access Control is off for new installations. If you enable it, "
"Authenticated Users Only is the default policy. Block All REST Access is "
"never the default."
msgstr ""
"Le contrôle d'accès REST API est désactivé pour les nouvelles installations."
" Si vous l'activez, Utilisateurs authentifies uniquement est la politique "
"par défaut. Bloquer tout accès REST n'est jamais la valeur par défaut."

