"Gutenberg, Santé du site, extensions, thèmes et intégrations peuvent cesser "
"de fonctionner."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "XML-RPC is fully disabled."
msgstr "XML-RPC est entièrement désactivé."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid ""
"Some applications and integrations that depend on XML-RPC may stop working."
msgstr ""
"Certaines applications et intégrations qui dépendent de XML-RPC peuvent "
"cesser de fonctionner."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Permissions-Policy has an invalid or empty configuration."
msgstr "Permissions-Policy a une configuration invalide ou vide."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "The header is enabled but no valid directive is generated."
msgstr "L’en-tête est activé, mais aucune directive valide n’est générée."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "A security header conflict was detected."
msgstr "Un conflit d’en-tête de sécurité a été détecté."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid ""
"Another server, CDN, or plugin appears to send a security header that does "
"not match this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Un autre serveur, CDN ou plugin semble envoyer un en-tête de sécurité qui ne"
" correspond pas à cette extension."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid ""
"CSP is independent of Security Profiles. Enable it from the Content Security"
" Policy screen when you are ready."
msgstr ""
"La CSP est indépendante des Security Profiles. Activez-la depuis l’écran "
"Content Security Policy lorsque vous êtes prêt."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Content Security Policy is in Report Only mode."
msgstr "La Content Security Policy est en mode Report Only."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid ""
"Learning uses Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only and does not block "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"L’apprentissage utilise Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only et ne bloque pas"
" les ressources."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Content Security Policy configuration is invalid."
msgstr "La configuration de la Content Security Policy n’est pas valide."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Enable at least one CSP directive before sending the header."
msgstr "Activez au moins une directive CSP avant d’envoyer l’en-tête."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "WordPress version hiding is enabled without generator outputs."
msgstr "Le masquage de version WordPress est activé sans sorties générateur."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Turn on Hide Generator Meta Version or Hide Version from Feeds."
msgstr "Activez Hide Generator Meta Version ou Hide Version from Feeds."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Referrer-Policy is set to unsafe-url."
msgstr "Referrer-Policy est défini sur unsafe-url."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "XML-RPC custom policy has no methods configured."
msgstr "La politique XML-RPC personnalisée n’a aucune méthode configurée."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid ""
"Add allowed or blocked method names, or choose another protection mode."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez des noms de méthodes autorisées ou bloquées, ou choisissez un autre "
"mode de protection."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "REST Selected Roles has no roles chosen."
msgstr "REST Selected Roles n’a aucun rôle choisi."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Select at least one WordPress role or choose another access policy."
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez au moins un rôle WordPress ou choisissez une autre politique "
"d’accès."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "X-XSS-Protection report policy is missing a reporting URL."
msgstr "La politique de rapport X-XSS-Protection n’a pas d’URL de reporting."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Add a reporting URL or choose another X-XSS-Protection policy."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez une URL de reporting ou choisissez une autre politique X-XSS-"
"Protection."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "Another layer sends %s while this plugin does not."
msgstr "Une autre couche envoie %s alors que cette extension ne le fait pas."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgid "The public %s value does not match this plugin."
msgstr "La valeur publique de %s ne correspond pas à cette extension."

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgctxt "CSP status"
msgid "Report Only"
msgstr "Report Only"

#: includes/class-ash-security-status.php:1
msgctxt "CSP status"
msgid "Invalid Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration invalide"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid ""
"Export or import plugin configuration, and choose what happens to stored "
"data on uninstall."
msgstr ""
"Exportez ou importez la configuration de l'extension, et choisissez le sort "
"des données enregistrées lors de la désinstallation."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Export and Import"
msgstr "Export et import"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid ""
"Download a JSON file of all plugin settings, or restore them from a previous"
" export."
msgstr ""
"Téléchargez un fichier JSON de tous les réglages de l'extension, ou "
"restaurez-les depuis un export précédent."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid ""
"Export includes Security Headers, Security Features, Content Security "
"Policy, Security Profile, uninstall settings, and CSP Assistant scan "
"exclusions."
msgstr ""
"L'export inclut Security Headers, Security Features, Content Security "
"Policy, Security Profile, les réglages de désinstallation et les exclusions "
"d'analyse du CSP Assistant."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Exporter"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid ""
"Import replaces the current plugin configuration on this site. Choose a JSON"
" file exported from Abdal Security Headers."
msgstr ""
"L'import remplace la configuration actuelle de l'extension sur ce site. "
"Choisissez un fichier JSON exporté depuis Abdal Security Headers."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Import cannot be undone from this screen."
msgstr "L'import ne peut pas être annulé depuis cet écran."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid ""
"Security Headers, Security Features, Content Security Policy, Security "
"Profile, and Settings will be overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Security Headers, Security Features, Content Security Policy, Security "
"Profile et Settings seront écrasés."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Settings JSON file"
msgstr "Fichier JSON des réglages"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Choose file"
msgstr "Choisir un fichier"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "No file selected"
msgstr "Aucun fichier sélectionné"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Importer"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The export does not include CSP Assistant learning data or scan jobs."
msgstr ""
"L'export n'inclut ni les données d'apprentissage du CSP Assistant ni les "
"tâches d'analyse."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Import settings"
msgstr "Importer les réglages"

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid ""
"Import will replace current plugin settings, including Security Headers, "
"Security Features, Content Security Policy, Security Profile, and Settings. "
"This cannot be undone from this screen."
msgstr ""
"L'import remplacera les réglages actuels de l'extension, y compris Security "
"Headers, Security Features, Content Security Policy, Security Profile et "
"Settings. Cette action ne peut pas être annulée depuis cet écran."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Settings file downloaded."
msgstr "Le fichier de réglages a été téléchargé."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Settings were imported. The page will reload."
msgstr "Les réglages ont été importés. La page va se recharger."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "Choose a settings JSON file before importing."
msgstr "Choisissez un fichier JSON de réglages avant d'importer."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The settings transfer could not be completed. Please try again."
msgstr "Le transfert des réglages n'a pas pu aboutir. Veuillez réessayer."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The requested settings transfer action is not valid."
msgstr "L'action de transfert des réglages demandée n'est pas valide."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The settings file could not be uploaded. Please try again."
msgstr "Le fichier de réglages n'a pas pu être téléversé. Veuillez réessayer."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The settings file is empty or larger than the allowed size."
msgstr "Le fichier de réglages est vide ou dépasse la taille autorisée."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The settings file could not be read."
msgstr "Le fichier de réglages n'a pas pu être lu."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The settings file must be a JSON export from this plugin."
msgstr "Le fichier de réglages doit être un export JSON de cette extension."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The settings file is not valid JSON."
msgstr "Le fichier de réglages n'est pas un JSON valide."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The settings file is not a valid Abdal Security Headers export."
msgstr ""
"Le fichier de réglages n'est pas un export Abdal Security Headers valide."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The settings file does not contain any configuration."
msgstr "Le fichier de réglages ne contient aucune configuration."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The exported Security Headers configuration is not valid."
msgstr "La configuration Security Headers exportée n'est pas valide."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid "The exported plugin settings are not valid."
msgstr "Les réglages de l'extension exportés ne sont pas valides."

#: includes/class-ash-admin-ui.php:1931
msgid ""
"The settings could not be imported completely. Previous settings were kept."
msgstr ""
"Les réglages n'ont pas pu être importés entièrement. Les réglages précédents"
" ont été conservés."
